{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 25,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.442138671875,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "Adherence to treatment was not adequately addressed in the reviewed studies to be included as",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.4321899414062,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "an outcome. However, in most studies included in the systematic review, intermittent dosing used",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        473.8809509277344,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "treatment support, while the use of treatment support during daily dosing was variable.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.49463653564453,
        527.4024658203125,
        129.93763732910156
      ],
      "text": "The GDG also considered that health equity would be adversely affected with intermittent dosing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        128.69459533691406,
        527.4177856445312,
        143.13758850097656
      ],
      "text": "because more vulnerable populations would receive inferior treatment if intermittent dosing were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        141.8946075439453,
        527.4454345703125,
        156.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "used. This is because people living in more resource-constrained settings would be at greater risk of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.09474182128906,
        527.3938598632812,
        169.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "missing doses of medication, not only because of their difficulty in reaching a clinic but also because",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        168.29469299316406,
        527.4431762695312,
        182.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "of the risk of medication stock-outs in clinics. Additionally, patients who are co-infected with HIV or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        181.4947052001953,
        527.384765625,
        195.9376983642578
      ],
      "text": "have other comorbidities may not absorb TB medications well and therefore they may receive less",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        194.69471740722656,
        527.389404296875,
        209.13771057128906
      ],
      "text": "medication than they are ingesting. In order for TB medication to be used as part of a treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.8946075439453,
        527.4081420898438,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "regimen, no doses may be missed with thrice-weekly intermittent dosing during the continuation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.09474182128906,
        527.386962890625,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "phase because the rates of unfavourable outcomes may rise. Consequently, populations that are",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.29469299316406,
        527.3848266601562,
        248.73768615722656
      ],
      "text": "more vulnerable are at risk of missing doses of medication or of not absorbing the doses well, and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        247.4947052001953,
        524.5831298828125,
        261.9377136230469
      ],
      "text": "intermittent dosing puts them in a situation where there is an increased risk of unfavourable outcomes.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.963540077209473,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.1986083984375,
        527.242919921875,
        283.6416320800781
      ],
      "text": "Intermittent dosing may also create problems at national and international levels by resulting in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        282.39862060546875,
        527.2046508789062,
        296.8416442871094
      ],
      "text": "requirements for different drug manufacturing and packaging and a reduced drug supply buffer,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        295.5986328125,
        328.0626525878906,
        310.0416564941406
      ],
      "text": "leading to an increased risk of TB medication stock-outs.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        317.302490234375,
        527.4280395507812,
        331.7455139160156
      ],
      "text": "Given the findings in this review, all countries are encouraged to use daily dosing exclusively in both",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        330.5025939941406,
        527.123291015625,
        344.94561767578125
      ],
      "text": "the intensive and the continuation phases of treatment. Although two separate evidence assessments",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.981985092163086,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        343.7025146484375,
        527.634765625,
        358.1455383300781
      ],
      "text": "were conducted on thrice-weekly dosing in the intensive phase and the continuation phase, both the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.991496086120605,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        356.9026184082031,
        527.4287719726562,
        371.34564208984375
      ],
      "text": "formulated recommendations were conditional and there was very low certainty in the evidence. A",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        370.10260009765625,
        527.4388427734375,
        384.5456237792969
      ],
      "text": "combined recommendation for both intensive and continuation phases was formulated to make it",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        383.3025207519531,
        265.98297119140625,
        397.74554443359375
      ],
      "text": "more convenient for use by the end-users.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        411.11981201171875,
        209.15652465820312,
        426.9718017578125
      ],
      "text": "Subgroup considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        434.1797180175781,
        479.0354919433594,
        448.62274169921875
      ],
      "text": "This recommendation is the same for HIV-negative people and for people living with HIV.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        455.8836975097656,
        527.43212890625,
        470.32672119140625
      ],
      "text": "The data used in this review examined only patients with drug-susceptible pulmonary TB who had",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        469.0836181640625,
        527.4058837890625,
        483.5266418457031
      ],
      "text": "no extenuating circumstances – such as adverse reactions which might require modification of the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        482.28369140625,
        150.68209838867188,
        496.7267150878906
      ],
      "text": "dosing schedule.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        503.98760986328125,
        527.4100341796875,
        518.4306030273438
      ],
      "text": "Children were not considered specifically in this review. However, there is no biologically plausible",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        517.1876220703125,
        527.1126098632812,
        531.630615234375
      ],
      "text": "reason why this recommendation should not also apply to children. It is recommended that all children",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.962486267089844,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        530.3875732421875,
        527.564208984375,
        544.83056640625
      ],
      "text": "receive daily dosing of TB medications during the intensive and continuation phases of therapy for the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.971914291381836,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        542.3116455078125,
        527.373779296875,
        558.0306396484375
      ],
      "text": "Guidance for national tuberculosis programmes on  same reason as adults. See WHO’s 2014 guideline",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.994399070739746,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        555.5115966796875,
        527.4169311523438,
        571.2305908203125
      ],
      "text": "the management of tuberculosis in children (18)  for recommendations on the daily dosing of children",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        569.9876098632812,
        124.04010009765625,
        584.4306030273438
      ],
      "text": "with DS-TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        597.8048095703125,
        245.23455810546875,
        613.6568603515625
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        620.8646850585938,
        527.427734375,
        635.3076782226562
      ],
      "text": "There are no new implementation considerations as the recommended daily treatment is already",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        634.0648193359375,
        527.3935546875,
        648.5078125
      ],
      "text": "widespread practice. However, intermittent dosing is still used in some countries. In such exceptional",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        647.2647705078125,
        527.66845703125,
        661.707763671875
      ],
      "text": "cases, implementation of the recommendation to use exclusively daily dosing in the intensive",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        660.46484375,
        527.2706298828125,
        674.9078369140625
      ],
      "text": "and continuation phases of TB therapy is likely to have implications for medication procurement,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        673.6646728515625,
        405.75347900390625,
        688.107666015625
      ],
      "text": "practitioner training, change of programme practice and patient support.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        701.4819946289062,
        220.46530151367188,
        717.3340454101562
      ],
      "text": "Monitoring and evaluation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        724.5419311523438,
        527.420166015625,
        738.9849243164062
      ],
      "text": "There are no new monitoring and evaluation recommendations as the standard of care (daily dosing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        737.7418823242188,
        511.36004638671875,
        752.1848754882812
      ],
      "text": "of medications during the intensive and continuation phases of therapy) is being recommended.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        320.85479736328125,
        801.0170288085938,
        554.0401611328125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "Chapter 1 Drug-susceptible TB treatment: Recommendations 11",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    }
  ]
}